  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Parliamentary Institute of Cambodia (regional program)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Parliamentary Institute of Cambodia (regional program)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By the end of 2019, about 200 parliamentarians and parliamentary staff in Southeast Asia have increased capacity in legislative and democratic development in the region. The capacity of parliamentarians in Southeast Asia to engage constructively in the legislative process will be strengthened through the provision of research products which follow standard practices for parliamentary research services globally and the provision of regional exchange. The regional activities will comprise trainings for regional fellows on parliamentary research, English, legal analysis, legislative drafting, parliamentary communications, public policy evaluation, parliamentary budget analysis, regional comparatives studies, regional information exchange network, and seminars. The parliaments with well-equipped knowledge will be better respond to the constituents&#x2019; needs and local reality. Capacity building will eventually lead to a better sharing of power, an improved management of conflicting interests and effective systems of checks and balances as key elements for enhanced governance.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">I slutet av 2019, f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas cirka 200 parlamentariker och parlamentarisk personal i Sydostasien ha &#xf6;kad kapacitet i lagstiftnings- och demokratisk utveckling. Kapaciteten hos parlamentariker i Sydostasien att engagera sig p&#xe5; ett konstruktivt s&#xe4;tt i lagstiftningsprocessen kommer att f&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkas genom tillhandah&#xe5;llande av forskningsprodukter som f&#xf6;ljer standardmetoder f&#xf6;r parlamentarisk forskning globalt och genom regionalt utbyte. De regionala aktiviteterna kommer att omfatta utbildningar inom parlamentarisk forskning, engelska, juridisk analys, lagberedning, riksdagskommunikation, utv&#xe4;rdering, parlamentariska budgetanalys, regionala j&#xe4;mf&#xf6;relsetal, regionalt informationsutbyte samt n&#xe4;tverk och seminarier. Mer v&#xe4;lutrustade med kunskap kommer parlamenten bli b&#xe4;ttre svara p&#xe5; behov fr&#xe5;n den lokala verkligheten. Kapacitetsuppbyggnad f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas s&#xe5; sm&#xe5;ningom att leda till en b&#xe4;ttre f&#xf6;rdelning av makt, en f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad hantering av motstridiga intressen och effektiva system f&#xf6;r maktf&#xf6;rdelning som nyckelfaktorer f&#xf6;r &#xf6;kad styrning.</narrative>
  </description>
